  "description": "Full Planning Permission is sought for the following: \n\n“Temporary installation of 80 freestanding Sheffield cycle stands for public use at the western end of the British Library Piazza; temporary installation of 54 two tier stands, 8 Sheffield stands and a cycle maintenance station within the Ossulston Street undercroft; installation of a temporary gated access system with associated access control equipment”  \n\nListed building consent is sought for the following: \n\n“Temporary alterations comprising: the installation of two‑tier and Sheffield cycle parking stands and a cycle maintenance station within the Ossulston Street undercroft; installation of a temporary gated access system with associated access control equipment; and associated localised lifting and reinstatement of brick paving for below‑ground fixings.” ",
